Build mpv and FFmpeg for Apple devices as LGPL-2.1-or-later.

Applied by .github/workflows/mpv-audio-driver.yml to edde746/mpv-build at
c6f7e635c2c8681fa13c2c678f0e61ae46fe8bc6 before it builds FFmpeg and libmpv.
mpv drops -Dgpl=true. FFmpeg drops --enable-gpl, --enable-version3 and the
GPL-only delogo filter (Vivid never uses it), and reads HTTPS through
Apple's Secure Transport instead of OpenSSL, so OpenSSL is no longer linked.
None of mpv's or FFmpeg's GPL-only parts apply to iOS or tvOS.

